{
  "key": 24598,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "SpearPillar_Text_TakeYouDown",
      "en_US": [
        "Our boss is about to do something\n",
        "spectacular!\r",
        "Don’t get in the way!\n",
        "Of course you will, won’t you?\r",
        "That’s why the two of us will team up\n",
        "to take you down in an epic duel!\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Le chef s’apprête à faire un truc\n",
        "extraordinaire!\r",
        "Mets pas ton nez dans nos affaires!\n",
        "Tu ne veux pas nous écouter, hein?\r",
        "Tant pis pour toi, on va pas se gêner\n",
        "pour te botter les fesses!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SpearPillar_Text_OnlyOnePokemon",
      "en_US": [
        "Our boss is about to do something\n",
        "spectacular!\r",
        "Don’t get in the way!\n",
        "Of course you will, won’t you?\r",
        "That’s why the two of us will team up\n",
        "to take you down in an epic duel!\r",
        "What? You only have one Pokémon?\n",
        "Bah, come back when you’re ready!\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Le chef s’apprête à faire un truc\n",
        "extraordinaire!\r",
        "Mets pas ton nez dans nos affaires!\n",
        "Tu ne veux pas nous écouter, hein?\r",
        "Tant pis pour toi, on va pas se gêner\n",
        "pour te botter les fesses!\r",
        "Quoi? Tu n’as qu’un Pokémon? Pff,\n",
        "reviens quand ton équipe sera prête!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SpearPillar_Text_WeLetYouPass",
      "en_US": [
        "We are not capable of slowing you.\r",
        "We will let you pass so you can get\n",
        "pulverized by our bosses!"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Eh ben, tu es trop coriace pour nous...\r",
        "On va te laisser passer, mais nos chefs\n",
        "se chargeront de te pulvériser, va!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SpearPillar_Text_GoThroughMeFirst",
      "en_US": [
        "Mars: Where do you think you’re going?\n",
        "I won’t let you disturb our boss.\r",
        "If you’re not going to listen, you’ll\n",
        "have to go through me first.\r",
        "After all, you’ve made me look bad\n",
        "more times than I care to remember!\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Mars: Tu vas où comme ça? Je ne te\n",
        "laisserai pas déranger le chef.\r",
        "Il faudra d’abord me passer sur\n",
        "le corps.\r",
        "Après tout, je ne compte même plus les\n",
        "fois où tu m’as mise dans l’embarras!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SpearPillar_Text_IllBeNext",
      "en_US": [
        "Jupiter: And I’ll be next.\r",
        "You might be tough, but this time,\n",
        "the gloves are coming off!\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Jupiter: A moi, maintenant.\r",
        "Tu es peut-être coriace, mais cette\n",
        "fois, je ne prendrai pas de gants!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SpearPillar_Text_DontPartyWithoutMe",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}: Hold on one second!\r",
        "Don’t you start the party without\n",
        "me!\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}: Hé, une minute!\r",
        "On ne commence pas la fête sans moi!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SpearPillar_Text_Dummy6",
      "garbage": 28
    },
    {
      "id": "SpearPillar_Text_Huh",
      "en_US": "Jupiter: Huh?\r",
      "fr_FR": "Jupiter: Hein?\r"
    },
    {
      "id": "SpearPillar_Text_ImHereForRevenge",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}: Remember me?\n",
        "I’m here to get my revenge!\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}: Vous vous souvenez de\n",
        "moi? Je viens prendre ma revanche!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SpearPillar_Text_LetsBattleTwoOnTwo",
      "en_US": [
        "Jupiter: Ha!\n",
        "If it isn’t that little boy.\f",
        "The little crybaby from Lake Acuity.\r",
        "Did you toughen up a bit?\n",
        "Sure, let’s battle two-on-two!\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Jupiter: Ah!\n",
        "Mais c’est le moucheron du Lac Savoir.\r",
        "Tu t’es amélioré depuis le temps? C’est\n",
        "ce qu’on va voir! En garde!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SpearPillar_Text_IllHelpYou",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}: ...Heh.\n",
        "My Pokémon are tough, right?\f",
        "I can get even tougher!\r",
        "...But, you know, that’s it for us.\n",
        "We’ve hit the wall...\r",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0}, I’ll help you with this!\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}: Hé... Ce sont des durs,\n",
        "mes Pokémon, pas vrai?\f",
        "Et ils peuvent encore progresser!\r",
        "Mais je crois qu’on est K.O...\n",
        "on a atteint notre limite...\r",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0}, je vais te donner\n",
        "un coup de main!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SpearPillar_Text_FullyHealedPokemon",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} fully healed\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0}’s Pokémon!\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} a totalement soigné les\n",
        "Pokémon appartenant à {STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0}!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SpearPillar_Text_ItsYourShowNow",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}: Hey, {STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0}!\n",
        "This is it! It’s your show now!\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}: Hé, {STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0}!\n",
        "C’est le moment! A toi de jouer!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SpearPillar_Text_EverythingIsReady",
      "en_US": [
        "Cyrus: ...\n",
        "...\r",
        "Everything is ready for the creation\n",
        "of a new world.\r",
        "Now, all will end.\n",
        "And everything will begin.\r",
        "With this, the Red Chain made from the\n",
        "crystals of the three lake Pokémon...\r",
        "And this, the Red Chain I replicated\n",
        "with technological means...\r",
        "With these Red Chains I will pry open\n",
        "the portal to another dimension.\r",
        "I command that you unleash your power\n",
        "for me...\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Hélio: ...\n",
        "...\r",
        "Tout est enfin prêt pour la création\n",
        "d’un monde nouveau.\r",
        "C’est ici que tout se termine.\n",
        "Et que tout recommence.\r",
        "Avec cette Chaîne Rouge, fabriquée à\n",
        "partir des cristaux des trois Pokémon\f",
        "lacustres...\r",
        "Et avec sa réplique, fruit de la\n",
        "technologie, je vais ouvrir un\f",
        "portail vers une autre dimension...\r",
        "Je vous ordonne de déchaîner votre\n",
        "puissance...\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SpearPillar_Text_DialgaMasterOfTime",
      "en_US": [
        "DIALGA, the mythical Pokémon, and\n",
        "the master of time!\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "DIALGA, Pokémon mythique, maître\n",
        "du temps!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SpearPillar_Text_Dummy15",
      "garbage": 17
    },
    {
      "id": "SpearPillar_Text_PalkiaMasterOfSpace",
      "en_US": [
        "...And the other.\r",
        "PALKIA, the mythical Pokémon, and\n",
        "the master of space and dimensions!\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Et toi aussi...\r",
        "PALKIA, Pokémon mythique, maître de\n",
        "l’espace et des dimensions!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SpearPillar_Text_Dummy17",
      "garbage": 14
    },
    {
      "id": "SpearPillar_Text_IWillCreateNewWorld",
      "en_US": [
        "Cyrus: I’ve waited so long for this\n",
        "moment, DIALGA and PALKIA.\r",
        "Shaping this world is a double spiral\n",
        "of time and space.\r",
        "Yes, the very things that you have the\n",
        "ability to control!\r",
        "You will do my bidding!\n",
        "I will have your abilities as mine!\r",
        "With the power I wield, I will create\n",
        "an entirely new world!\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Hélio: J’attends ce moment depuis si\n",
        "longtemps, DIALGA et PALKIA.\r",
        "La double spirale du temps et de\n",
        "l’espace façonne ce monde.\r",
        "Or, vous avez le pouvoir de contrôler\n",
        "ces deux choses!\r",
        "Je vous ordonne de m’obéir!\n",
        "Votre pouvoir sera mien!\r",
        "Et avec ce pouvoir, je créerai\n",
        "un monde entièrement nouveau!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SpearPillar_Text_NothingCanRemain",
      "en_US": [
        "The incomplete and ugly world we have\n",
        "now can disappear.\r",
        "I am resetting everything to zero.\n",
        "Nothing can remain.\r",
        "It is all for making the ultimate world.\n",
        "A world of complete perfection.\r",
        "Nothing so vague and incomplete as\n",
        "spirit can remain.\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Ce monde incomplet et imparfait peut\n",
        "désormais disparaître.\r",
        "Grâce à moi, tout repart de zéro.\n",
        "Il ne restera rien.\r",
        "Place au monde idéal, celui de la\n",
        "perfection ultime.\r",
        "Un monde dans lequel l’esprit, inachevé\n",
        "et lacunaire, n’a pas sa place.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SpearPillar_Text_IShouldHaveExpectedAsMuch",
      "en_US": [
        "Cyrus: ...I should have expected as\n",
        "much.\r",
        "UXIE, “The Being of Knowledge.”\r",
        "AZELF, “The Being of Willpower.”\r",
        "And MESPRIT, “The Being of Emotion”...\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Hélio: J’aurais dû m’y attendre...\r",
        "CREHELF, “être du savoir”.\r",
        "CREFADET, “être de la volonté”.\r",
        "Et CREFOLLET, “être de l’émotion”...\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SpearPillar_Text_CantMaintainBalance",
      "en_US": [
        "The Pokémon have come to protect\n",
        "Sinnoh? Pathetic and worthless.\r",
        "It takes the three of them, the three\n",
        "lake Pokémon that symbolize spirit,\f",
        "to balance either the Pokémon of time\f",
        "or space.\r",
        "But they can’t maintain balance against\n",
        "the two.\r",
        "Not when both DIALGA and PALKIA are\n",
        "here.\r",
        "Their coming here is in vain.\n",
        "So much meaningless drama.\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Ces Pokémon sont venus protéger\n",
        "Sinnoh? Pathétique et inutile.\r",
        "Ils doivent s’y mettre à trois pour\n",
        "faire front face au Pokémon du temps\f",
        "ou de l’espace.\r",
        "Mais ils ne peuvent maintenir l’équilibre\n",
        "face aux deux à la fois.\r",
        "Pas en présence de DIALGA et PALKIA\n",
        "en même temps.\r",
        "Ils sont venus pour rien. Toutes ces\n",
        "histoires en vain.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SpearPillar_Text_MyDreamWillBeReality",
      "en_US": [
        "Now, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}.\r",
        "You’ve constantly interfered with my\n",
        "plans, but you will be forgiven.\r",
        "After all, there will remain no spirit\n",
        "for all time when I am done.\r",
        "All spirit will disappear.\n",
        "It will be ripped away...\r",
        "From you!\n",
        "From your Pokémon!\f",
        "From those precious to you...!\r",
        "It is time!\n",
        "My dream will be my reality!\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Bien, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}.\r",
        "Tu n’as eu de cesse de contrarier mes \n",
        "plans, mais je te pardonne.\r",
        "Après tout, quand j’aurai terminé,\n",
        "c’en sera fini de l’esprit à tout jamais.\r",
        "Toute forme d’esprit disparaîtra...\r",
        "Y compris le tien, ceux de tes\n",
        "Pokémon et de tous les gens qui te\f",
        "sont chers...!\r",
        "Il est temps!\n",
        "Mon rêve va devenir réalité!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SpearPillar_Text_WhatIsThisPressure",
      "en_US": [
        "What is this pressure I feel...?\n",
        "Something...is enraged?\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Quelle est cette pression...?\n",
        "Quelque chose... dégage une telle rage!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SpearPillar_Text_PokemonThatAppearsAsShadow",
      "en_US": [
        "Cyrus: Interesting.\r",
        "So, there is a Pokémon that can only\n",
        "appear as a shadow.\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Hélio: Intéressant.\r",
        "Ainsi donc, il existe un Pokémon qui ne\n",
        "peut apparaître que sous la forme\f",
        "d’une ombre.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SpearPillar_Text_IHaveHarnessedPowers",
      "en_US": [
        "Regardless, the effort is rash and\n",
        "foolish.\r",
        "I have harnessed the powers of DIALGA\n",
        "and PALKIA...\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Qu’importe, la manœuvre est vouée\n",
        "à l’échec.\r",
        "J’ai fait miens les pouvoirs de\n",
        "DIALGA et PALKIA...\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SpearPillar_Text_NoMoreInterference",
      "en_US": [
        "I, Cyrus, won’t have any more\n",
        "interferererererere...!"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Moi, Hélio, je refuse toute nouvelle\n",
        "interrupruprup...!"
      ]
    },
